on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  2] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [  4] extcall 44 .............................. <soundBusy(1)>
  [  6] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [  8] eq ...................................... <soundBusy(1) = 1>
  [  9] jmpifz [ 18] ............................ if soundBusy(1) = 1 then
  [ 12] pushcons 0 .............................. <"Petts2">
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"Petts2">
